  "description": "Unleash your adventure with the DAHON E-Hemingway, the electric version of our classic Hemingway model. Seamlessly combining iconic design with modern e-bike innovation, the E-Hemingway offers exceptional comfort, power, and portability. Whether you're commuting or exploring, its advanced motor and foldable frame make every journey effortless and unforgettable.\n\nAdjustable Comfort, Smart Control\n\nEnjoy a fully customizable ride with the adjustable stem, allowing you to fine-tune both height and angle for maximum comfort. The intuitive display offers 5 levels of assist and provides real-time data on speed, distance, battery life, and more, keeping you informed every mile of the journey.\n\nEffortless Folding, Unmatched Reliability\n\nExperience ultimate convenience with a foldable frame and adjustable seatpost for customizable height. Built with DAHON’s patented folding technology, this system ensures safety and durability, giving you peace of mind on every ride.\n\nPowered by DAHON-V\n\nThe DELTECH cable is engineered for superior strength and long-lasting performance. Designed to withstand the demands of everyday cycling, it ensures smooth shifting and braking, offering reliable functionality for an enhanced riding experience.\n\nPower and Safety in Every Ride\n\nWith patented safety tech and Samsung cells, the DAHON seatpost battery offers 36V 9.5AH capacity, providing up to 100 km of reliable, long-lasting power.\n\nSmooth Power, Effortless Control\n\nThe system adapts to your pedaling, delivering steady power without sudden jolts or interruptions, offering a smooth, responsive ride that feels perfectly in sync with your movements.",
